[b]Map Street View 3.0 is out, built for game version 2.5.[/b]

I went through every comment on this page and fixed what you reported:

[list]
[*][b]Mouse support[/b]: hold right mouse and drag to rotate and tilt. A quick right-click still sets a waypoint. No Input Loader needed.
[*][b]Zooming no longer resets your tilt[/b].
[*][b]Drift fixed[/b]: the map no longer rotates or slides on its own.
[*][b]The right stick only rotates now[/b]; it doesn't slide the map at the same time.
[*][b]Rotation sounds can be turned off[/b], or grab the Silent file.
[*]The map remembers your view between visits; hold Jump to V to reset it.
[*]Options for deadzone, sensitivity, inverting, and pan speed. Change them in the settings file, or in-game with Mod Settings (optional).
[/list]

If you used [i]Map Rotation with Mouse[/i], uninstall it; this covers the same thing and the two conflict.

Found a bug? Turn on [b]Debug overlay[/b] in the settings, open the map, and post a screenshot with your game version.

Source is now on GitHub: [url=https://github.com/bknie1/MapStreetView]github.com/bknie1/MapStreetView[/url]

Thank you for sticking around, chooms!
